====Results====
Figures won eight counties, performing best in the two westernmost counties of the district: [[Mobile County, Alabama|Mobile]] and [[Washington County, Alabama|Washington]]. Daniels won four counties in the eastern part, securing his best result in [[Bullock County, Alabama|Bullock County]], where he graduated from high school. Bracy likewise performed well in the western portion of the district, carrying [[Clarke County, Alabama|Clarke County]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.anthonyforalabama.com/ |title=Anthony Daniels for Alabama |access-date=24 March 2024}}</ref> 
